      "text": "McTavish with his 9G of the season, 2-1. He now has points in three straight games. Good forecheck by Stenberg. Monty put Toropchenko on the line in Dvorsky's spot and Toropchenko's physical play gave McTavish some extra room. And boy does McTavish have some hands. #stlblues",
